[?2004l[?2004h> Apache Druid versions up to 0.20.0 contain a vulnerability in the JavaScript filter implementation that allows authenticated attackers to execute arbitrary code on the server. The vulnerability exists in the way Jackson deserializes filter specifications when `FAIL_ON_UNKNOWN_PROPERTIES` is set to false.
[?2004l[?2004h> 
