[?2004l[?2004h>    git apply /root/patches/0001-fix-javascript-filter-empty-key-vulnerability.patch
[?2004l[?2004h>    ```
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> 3. Rebuild the affected modules:
[?2004l[?2004h>    ```bash
[?2004l[?2004h>    mvn clean package -DskipTests -Dcheckstyle.skip=true -Dpmd.skip=true \
[?2004l[?2004h>      -Dforbiddenapis.skip=true -Dspotbugs.skip=true -Danimal.sniffer.skip=true \
[?2004l[?2004h>      -Denforcer.skip=true -Djacoco.skip=true -Ddependency-check.skip=true \
[?2004l[?2004h>      -pl '!web-console' -pl indexing-service -am
[?2004l[?2004h>    ```
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> 4. Deploy the patched JAR files:
