[?2004l[?2004h> 2. **Malicious payloads** containing Java API calls are rejected with an `IllegalArgumentException`
[?2004l[?2004h> 3. **Empty key payloads** are safely ignored by Jackson and don't bypass security checks
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## Testing
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> The fix can be tested by attempting to create a JavaScript filter with a dangerous API call:
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ```json
[?2004l[?2004h> POST /druid/indexer/v1/sampler HTTP/1.1
[?2004l[?2004h> Content-Type: application/json
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> {
[?2004l[?2004h>   "type": "index",
